  "description": "As an army special forces officer, I died during training and then possessed a child in a novel. She was only five years old.\n\nIf I get caught by my maternal uncle like this, I'd just be used and eventually die. So I must twisted the original story to escape, which is why I decided to entrust myself to the Grand Duke's family.\n\n\"Will you be my daughter-in-law?\"\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11343725)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851388), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14246820)",
